WEBVTT

00:00:01.024 --> 00:00:05.947
The Inbox, two unread emails among read ones.

00:00:05.947 --> 00:00:08.812
Mail preferences, Deleting: the option that decides what opens after a delete.

00:00:08.812 --> 00:00:12.256
Pick the option. The example under it shows what a delete leaves open.

00:00:12.256 --> 00:00:12.761
Open an email.

00:00:12.761 --> 00:00:15.561
Delete it from the reader.

00:00:15.561 --> 00:00:17.767
Nothing is selected: the reader asks you to pick an email.
